# mqttd for the cloud single-node comparison: the SAME image users pull, run with
# its durable-by-default explicitly turned OFF (ADR 0048 §4 forbids buying "fast"
# by quietly turning a guarantee off without saying so — this says so). The
# competitors here keep sessions in memory, so this is the like-for-like posture;
# mqttd's durable path is measured by a different harness (DURABLE-PATH.md).
MQTTD_PLAINTEXT_BIND=0.0.0.0:1883
MQTTD_ALLOW_ANONYMOUS=1
MQTTD_DURABLE_SESSIONS=0
MQTTD_HEALTH_BIND=0.0.0.0:8080
